 tornado of metal and blades, at the cost of briefly leaving its warshard core vulnerable. All creatures within a @Template[type:emanation|distance:20] must succeed at a @Check[reflex|dc:33] save or take @Damage[10d10[slashing],3d8[void]|options:area-damage] damage. The Scourge can't use To Shreds for [[/gmr 1d4 #rounds]]{1d4 rounds}.</p>\n<p>If the Scourge is targeted by a Reactive Strike as a result of using this action, it takes a –2 circumstance penalty to its AC; if the Reactive Strike disrupts this action, this penalty remains until the start of the Scourge's next turn.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-effects.Item.vaqiHzEewOKDx6rP]{Effect: To Shreds (AC Penalty)}</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":["manipulate","void"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!Q5OAv2oNk0aQF11l.B3tpwN7dZEoStsev"}],"name":"The Scourge of Woodsedge","system":{"abilities":{"cha":{"mod":4},"con":{"mod":8},"dex":{"mod":5},"int":{"mod":-2},"str":{"mod":8},"wis":{"mod":0}},"attributes":{"ac":{"details":"","value":34},"allSaves":{"value":""},"hardness":{"value":5},"hp":{"details":"void healing","max":345,"temp":0,"value":10},"immunities":[{"type":"bleed"},{"exceptions":[],"type":"dazzled"},{"exceptions":[],"type":"death-effects"},{"exceptions":[],"type":"disease"},{"exceptions":[],"type":"doomed"},{"exceptions":[],"type":"emotion"},{"exceptions":[],"type":"fatigued"},{"exceptions":[],"type":"fear-effects"},{"exceptions":[],"type":"healing"},{"exceptions":[],"type":"nonlethal-attacks"},{"exceptions":[],"type":"poison"},{"exceptions":[],"type":"sickened"},{"exceptions":[],"type":"unconscious"}],"resistances":[{"doubleVs":["non-magical"],"exceptions":[],"type":"physical","value":10}],"speed":{"details":"bladed levitation","otherSpeeds":[{"type":"fly","valu